        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Meaning changes between training and non-training days."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Liftly連携時は、トレーニング強度や経過時間も加味されます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
